{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "drawer",
  "title": "Drawer",
  "group": "Overlays",
  "order": 5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A panel that slides in from the right edge on wide screens for filters, details or a secondary task, while the list it belongs to stays visible. It leaves to the side it came from.",
    "id": "Panel yang bergeser masuk dari tepi kanan di layar lebar untuk filter, detail, atau tugas sekunder, sementara daftar asalnya tetap terlihat. Ia keluar ke sisi asalnya."
  },
  "titleId": "Drawer",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Filter applications",
        "desc": "It slides in from the right on a spring and leaves to the right, faster. Escape, the close button or the scrim close it; focus returns to Filters.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"dr-filter\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span>Filters</button>\n    <p class=\"section__sub\">48 micro business permit applications</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"dr-filter\" style=\"background: rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.12);\"></div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"dr-filter\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dr-filter-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"dr-filter-t\">Filters</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Close filters\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Past the deadline</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Needs verification</span></label>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" style=\"flex: 1;\">Clear</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" style=\"flex: 1;\" data-lds-close>Show 12 results</button></div>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Row details",
        "desc": "A read-only record beside the list, without a scrim: the page stays usable.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"dr-inv\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Bill 2024-118</button>\n  </div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"dr-inv\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dr-inv-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"dr-inv-t\">Bill 2024-118</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Close bill\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <p class=\"section__sub\">Waste collection fee, second half of the year. Issued 2 September, paid 9 September by bank transfer.</p>\n    <span class=\"badge badge--success\">Paid</span>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: auto;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md btn--block\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Download PDF</button></div>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Filter permohonan",
        "desc": "Bergeser masuk dari kanan dengan spring dan keluar ke kanan, lebih cepat. Escape, tombol tutup, atau scrim menutupnya; fokus kembali ke Filter.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"dr-filter\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span>Filter</button>\n    <p class=\"section__sub\">48 permohonan izin usaha mikro</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"scrim\" data-lds-scrim=\"dr-filter\" style=\"background: rgba(9, 9, 11, 0.12);\"></div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"dr-filter\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dr-filter-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"dr-filter-t\">Filter</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Tutup filter\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Melewati batas waktu</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"check__box\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Perlu diverifikasi</span></label>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" style=\"flex: 1;\">Hapus filter</button><button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" style=\"flex: 1;\" data-lds-close>Tampilkan 12 hasil</button></div>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Detail baris",
        "desc": "Data baca-saja di samping daftar, tanpa scrim: halaman tetap bisa dipakai.",
        "html": "<div class=\"viewport docs-box\">\n  <div class=\"viewport__content\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" data-lds-open=\"dr-inv\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Tagihan 2024-118</button>\n  </div>\n  <aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"dr-inv\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dr-inv-t\" data-lds-layer>\n    <div class=\"sheet__head\" style=\"margin: 0;\"><h3 class=\"sheet__title\" id=\"dr-inv-t\">Tagihan 2024-118</h3><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Tutup tagihan\" data-lds-close style=\"margin: -10px -10px -10px 0;\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button></div>\n    <p class=\"section__sub\">Retribusi kebersihan, semester kedua. Diterbitkan 2 September, dibayar 9 September lewat transfer bank.</p>\n    <span class=\"badge badge--success\">Lunas</span>\n    <div style=\"margin-top: auto;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md btn--block\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Unduh PDF</button></div>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
